.DS_Store

# --- MultiQC run metadata -------------------------------------------------
# MultiQC writes its report + data dir as `ddi_report.html` / `ddi_report_data/`
# (see `--filename` in modules/local/evaluation). These embed a run timestamp,
# absolute work-dir paths and the MultiQC version, so they differ on every run
# and machine.
**/ddi_report.html
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc.log
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc.parquet
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc_data.json
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc_sources.txt
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc_software_versions.txt
**/ddi_report_data/llms-full.txt
**/multiqc_plots/{svg,pdf,png}/*.{svg,pdf,png}

# Everything else -- trained models, predictions, metrics, curves -- is asserted
# by content. It used to be excluded because two runs with the same --seed still
# diverged; see bin/determinism.py for what closed that gap (fixed
# PYTHONHASHSEED, sorted iteration instead of set order, a per-fit reseed hook
# for joblib workers, seeded valid splits, single-stream cuML). If a library
# bump legitimately moves the numbers, regenerate the snapshot rather than
# re-adding exclusions here -- an exclusion would also hide a real regression.

pipeline_info/*.{html,json,txt,yml}
